## 8. Performance Benchmarks

### 8.1 MS MARCO Passage Ranking (Dev Set)

| Model | MRR@10 | nDCG@10 | Recall@100 | Index Size | Query Latency |
|-------|--------|---------|------------|------------|---------------|
| BM25 | 0.187 | 0.259 | 0.731 | 1.2 GB | ~5 ms |
| DPR | 0.326 | 0.398 | 0.887 | 4.5 GB | ~50 ms |
| ANCE | 0.330 | 0.404 | 0.892 | 4.5 GB | ~50 ms |
| ColBERTv2 | 0.397 | 0.473 | 0.938 | 12 GB | ~150 ms |
| **SPLADE v1** | 0.368 | 0.442 | 0.923 | **0.8 GB** | **~15 ms** |
| **SPLADE v2 (max)** | **0.379** | **0.453** | **0.931** | **0.9 GB** | **~12 ms** |
| SPLADE-distil | 0.365 | 0.436 | 0.918 | 0.7 GB | ~8 ms |
| SPLADE-ensemble | 0.387 | 0.461 | 0.935 | 2.5 GB | ~35 ms |

### 8.2 BEIR Benchmark (Zero-shot)

| Dataset | BM25 | SPLADE v2 | Contriever | GTR |
|---------|------|-----------|------------|-----|
| TREC-COVID | 0.656 | **0.742** | 0.689 | 0.712 |
| NFCorpus | 0.325 | **0.372** | 0.341 | 0.358 |
| FiQA | 0.236 | **0.328** | 0.298 | 0.312 |
| ArguAna | 0.315 | 0.402 | **0.448** | 0.421 |
| SciFact | 0.665 | **0.689** | 0.672 | 0.681 |
| **Average** | 0.412 | **0.482** | 0.458 | 0.471 |

### 8.3 Efficiency Comparison

| Metric | Dense (HNSW) | SPLADE (Inverted Index) |
|--------|--------------|-------------------------|
| **Index Build (1M docs)** | 45 min | 8 min |
| **Index Size (1M docs)** | 4.5 GB | 0.9 GB |
| **Memory (1M docs)** | 12 GB | 2 GB |
| **Query Latency (p99)** | 80 ms | 15 ms |
| **Throughput (QPS)** | 200 | 2000 |
| **Scalability** | Limited by RAM | Excellent (disk-based) |

